// A stimulus row can deliver a CAN frame: `can <id> <byte>...`. It goes in
// through csp_can_recv, so it takes the same path a bus frame takes -- shadow
// heap, can_mark_fields, and `.rx` raised by the commit.
//
// Frames for an id nothing declares are dropped, as on a real bus.
#buffer F:16 in can 0x20
#field  Cmd:8 F[0..7]
#field  Arg:8 F[8..15]

#variable Seen = 0        // cycles .rx was true
#variable Last = 0        // the last command that arrived
#variable Sum  = 0        // Arg accumulated, once per frame

Seen = Seen + 1 ? F.rx
Last = Cmd      ? F.rx
Sum  = Sum + Arg ? F.rx
